content.text:
Now loot.js: itemScore, DPS, thorns. Need careful DPS formula and itemScore with equipment. Let's patch.

DPS:
```
let shots = 1;
if (weapon.kind === 'knives') shots = weapon.count + stats.projectiles;
else if (weapon.kind === 'bolt') shots = 1 + stats.projectiles;
else if (weapon.kind === 'spear' || weapon.kind === 'orb') shots = 1 + Math.floor(stats.projectiles / 2);
// storm, cleave 1
```
But for orb, each projectile AoE can hit multiple, DPS undercounts AoE. Fine.
For cleave, can hit multiple, undercounts.
For storm, chain hits multiple, undercounts. Fine.
Maybe add `shots` for storm = 1 + max(0, chains-1)*0.35? For display, not critical. But itemScore chain bonus unique won't be reflected. Could include chain multiplier 0.35 per extra. But accuracy not crucial. Let's include `if kind==='storm' shots = 1 + Math.max(0, weapon.chains - 1) * 0.4;`. This makes Stormcaller better. Good.
For cleave, areaPct affects radius, not single target DPS; itemScore has area not included. Fine.

`itemScore` use equipment:
```
export function itemScore(item, boonStats, equipment = {}) {
 const before = aggregateEquipment(equipment, boonStats);
 const after = aggregateEquipment({...equipment,[item.slot]:item}, boonStats);
 ...
}
```
`itemPowerLabel(item, boonStats, equipment={})`.
Also compareRows maybe not include thorns/regen? fine.

Thorns: at end of aggregate, `flags.thorns += stats.thorns;` But unique Boneplate sets flags.thorns 18 and stats.thorns? Unique stats doesn't include thorns, flags only. Affix adds stats.thorns. So add. `flags.thorns += stats.thorns;` after loop. But `stats.thorns` may be included in boon? no. Good. Could also add display row for thorns. Add to UI stats maybe. Not necessary but useful. Add in renderStats rows `['Thorns', ...]` if >0? Simpler always show. But 15 rows may be fine. Could add. Let's do later.

Also `itemTooltipHTML` unique stats line will show unique stats and affixes. Fine.

Patch.

